# Build order

- Follow [docs/build-order.md](docs/build-order.md). Pause checklist: [docs/remaining.md](docs/remaining.md).
- Slices 1–8 are done (Colab files + training-pack export). Colab is still not production inference. Do not host a Colab runtime inside Icerde.
